This package builds a container image from third-party software, each under its own licence:

- OpenClaw (https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw), the assistant that runs in the container. MIT.
- @openclaw/firecrawl-plugin, the web fetch client bundled into the image. MIT.
- Litestream (https://github.com/benbjohnson/litestream), SQLite replication. Apache-2.0.
- tini, nftables, jemalloc, from the Debian packages of the base image. Their own licences.

The Worker uses @cloudflare/sandbox (Apache-2.0) and is deployed with wrangler (Apache-2.0 or MIT).
